{
  "id": "NUM.21",
  "number": "21",
  "bookId": "NUM",
  "reference": "Ekim. 21",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etorube a emun a ŋolo etiyaunitae a Eburonis",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iirari Ekanaanait ŋolo arae erwosit ka Arad, ŋolo eboi alo Negeb atemar itorunito Ŋisirael lorot ŋolo ka Asarim, abu tolot kitijik Ŋisirael, kikama Ŋisirael ŋice. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikoŋo Ŋisirael neni ke Ekapolon temasi, “Ani kipotok iyoŋ ŋituŋa lu napedor kosi, inyasunio isua ŋitaunio kec.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Ekapolon kiira ŋakiro a Ŋisirael kipotok Ŋikanaani napedor a Ŋisirael ka apotu Ŋisirael tomunyasi Ŋikanaani, kinyasut daŋ ŋitaunio kec. Aŋun, aponi tonyarae akibois ŋin Orima ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Orima",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "iŋes atemar akinyasuno",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Towotokis Ŋisirael alomoru Or, kitoro lowae ŋolo ka Anam a ŋina Areŋan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21:4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Anam ŋina Areŋan",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "enyaritae daŋ Anam ŋina ka asasaki",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kilugokis ekeereto akwap ke Edom. Nai abu tokadanak ŋituŋa alorot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kirworo ŋituŋa ŋuna aronok neni ka Akuj ka neni a Moses ebasi, “Kaanukiro ikiyauniata iyes isua alo Ijipit atwakare analoŋisat? Emam akimuj ka emam ŋakipi a ne; ikiup isua akinyam akimuj ŋina apyanan na.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Ekapolon kiyakik ŋituŋa ŋimuno ŋulu adwarak a ŋakisorito, tokonyakonyata ŋimuno ŋul ŋituŋa totwaka Ŋisirael ŋulu alalak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋituŋa potu neni a Moses a nen temasi, “Ikisec isua aŋuna erworore ŋuna aronok neni ke Ekapolon ka neni kon; kilip kareca neni ke Ekapolon tolema ŋimuno lu aneni kosi.” Aŋun, abu Moses kilip neni ke Ekapolon aŋuna a ŋituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok Ekapolon Moses tema, “Kitiyau etorube a emun a ŋolo a akisorit, ido kikacak lopir, ituŋanan daadaŋ ŋini ekonyi emun, emaikina kiŋoliya lotorube a emun a ŋol, ido eyari ituŋanan ŋin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Moses kitiyau etorube a emun a eburonis, ido kikacak lopir; apaki daadaŋ ŋina ekonyia emun ituŋanan idio, eŋoliyari ituŋanan ŋin neni a emun a ŋolo etiyaunitae ke eburonis, ido toyar.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Alosit tari Moab",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Towotokis Ŋisirael aneni alomito, tolomiyasi Obos. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Towotokis alo Obos, tolomiyasi Iyeabarim, naloŋisat ŋina alo Kide ŋina alokukoru a Ŋimoabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Towotokis Ŋisirael a nen tolomiyasi nayonae Sered. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Towotokis a nen tolomiyasi yaye Arinon, naloŋisat ŋina egeuni alokukoruu a Ŋiamoni, erae Arinon ekukoru a Ŋimoabi; kitoro Ŋisirael kidiŋ Ŋimoabi ka Ŋiamori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elimoritae alokitaabo a ŋolo ŋijiesyo a Ekapolon ebe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ikes a nen toloto kiŋaren todolo Beer, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21:16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Beer",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "iŋes atemar akare",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " iŋes akare ŋina alimokinia Ekapolon Moses ebe, “Tocunak ŋituŋa daadaŋ iwapei, ido ainakini ayoŋ ikes ŋakipi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Ŋisirael toeikis eete lo a nen:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kilounae Erwosit Sik",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyakiyasi nai Ŋisirael ŋituŋa neni a erwosit Sikon, erwosit a Ŋiamori, ebasi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ikilipit isua iyoŋ ikimyek isua totuboretei anakwap kon, nyeriyo isua lomanikorin a ŋikinyom, kori lomanikorin a ŋikito ke epiini, nyemasyo isua ŋakipi anakare ka adio, emekinio isua erot ŋolo a ŋirwosi akitodol ŋina etuborere isua anakwap kon.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai towou Sikon Ŋisirael atubor anakwap keŋ. Abu Sikon tocunak ŋituŋa keŋ daadaŋ, tolot akitijikin Ŋisirael analoŋisat; bu tari Yaas, kitijik Ŋisirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Ŋisirael toara ka kikamasi akwap keŋ ameun anayonae Arinon tari nayonae Yabok akitodol lokukoru a akwap a Ŋiamoni, atyono akitub ekukoru a Ŋiamoni, anerae ayakatar Ŋiamoni ŋasigarya ŋuna ajiok nooi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Ŋisirael kikamasi ŋitaunio a Ŋiamoni daadaŋ ka toloma lotaunio ŋul, toloma tari Esibon ka lorerya ŋulu edunyito Esibon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae Esibon etaun ŋolo apolon ŋolo a Sikon a erwosit a Ŋiamori, a ŋolo abu kitiji erwosit ŋolo sek epukat Moab ka abu kikama akwap ŋin daadaŋ akitodol Arinon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu Ŋisirael kiboikinos nakwap a Ŋiamori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyakiya Moses ŋituŋa akireb akwap a Yaser, kikamasi ikes ŋirerya ŋulu alodiyete Yaser daadaŋ, kiritasi Ŋiamori ŋulu eboiyete a nen.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
